              "{\"headline\":\"Trump trade official says U.S. and China are ‘in final weeks’ of talks for a deal\",\"alternativeHeadline\":\"U.S.-China trade talks reach 'final weeks,' LIghthizer says\",\"dateModified\":\"2019-03-12T18:18:05.000Z\",\"datePublished\":\"2019-03-12T18:18:05.000Z\",\"description\":\"Robert Lighthizer says the negotiations are “making headway” on the toughest issues.\",\"author\":{\"name\":\"David J. Lynch\"},\"isPartOf\":{\"name\":\"The Washington Post\",\"productID\":\"washingtonpost.com:basic\",\"description\":\"Breaking news and analysis on politics, business, world, national news, entertainment and more. In-depth DC, Virginia, Maryland news coverage including traffic, weather, crime, education, restaurant reviews and more.\",\"sku\":\"https://subscribe.washingtonpost.com\",\"brand\":{\"name\":\"The Washington Post\"}},\"publisher\":{\"name\":\"The Washington Post\"},\"isAccessibleForFree\":false}"
            ]
